# PCLN Phase 4 implementation

## Key files

| Feature | File |
|---------|------|
| Dynamic neurons | `src/model/dynamic_neurons.py` — `DynamicNeuronLayer`, `DynamicNeuronBlock` |
| Char tokenization | `src/data/__init__.py` — `CharLevelDataset`, `get_wikitext2_char_dataloader` |
| WikiText download | `src/data/__init__.py` — `download_wikitext2_direct`, `resolve_wikitext2_text_file` |
| Temporal / hierarchical PCN | `src/model/temporal_pcn.py` |
| Model factory | `src/model/factory.py` — shared train/chat/eval kwargs |
| Token codec | `src/data/text_codec.py` — must match dataset splitters |
| Training CLI | `scripts/train_full.py` |
| Benchmarks | `scripts/run_benchmarks.py` — exp1–5 configs |

## Data loader contract

All `get_*_dataloader` helpers return `(DataLoader, vocab_size, vocab_mappings)`.

`vocab_mappings` must include `tokenization`: `"word"`, `"char"`, or `"dummy"`.

## Known limitations

- `DynamicNeuronLayer`: rank-1 / top-k output; gate still dense over neurons
- `SparseMoEPCNBlock`: vectorized over time; Python loop over expert count
- Full-sequence next-token loss; encoder is causal on new runs

## Benchmark experiments

- exp1: word-level baseline
- exp2: char-level WikiText-2
- exp3: dynamic neurons, word-level
- exp5: temporal + hierarchical PCN

